</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><div style="position:absolute; top:26; left:31; width:648; height:357;"><div class="s14"><p class="s71"><span class="s72">Онкогены обозначают по нахождению </span></p><p class="s73"><span class="s74"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class="s74">v</span><span class="s74">-</span><span class="s74">onc</span><span class="s72"> – в вирусе (</span><span class="s72">v </span><span class="s72">-</span><span class="s72"> virus</span><span class="s72">) </span></p><p class="s73"><span class="s74"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class="s74">c </span><span class="s74">-</span><span class="s74">onc</span><span class="s72"> – в клетке (</span><span class="s72">c </span><span class="s72">-</span><span class="s72"> cellule</span><span class="s72">), </span></p><p class="s73"><span class="s72"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></p><p class="s73"><span class="s72"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;и по характеру опухоли: </span></p><p class="s73"><span class="s74"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class="s74">v</span><span class="s74">-</span><span class="s74">src</span><span class="s72"> </span><span class="s72">– вирус саркома Рауса, </span></p><p class="s73"><span class="s74"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class="s74">c</span><span class="s74">-</span><span class="s74">myc</span><span class="s72"> – клеточный онкоген миелоцитарного лейкоза, </span></p><p class="s73"><span class="s74"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class="s74">c</span><span class="s74">-</span><span class="s74">erb</span><span class="s72"> – клеточный онкоген эритробластоза, </span></p><p class="s73"><span class="s74"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class="s74">c</span><span class="s74"> - </span><span class="s74">myb</span><span class="s72"> – клеточный онкоген миелобластного лейкоза</span></p></div></div></div><style type="text/css">
